From 3f1f19def1cd11f62424ccb8091c652c714efc35 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Saturn <saturn@localhost>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 15:48:29 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 11/13] Saturn: square hovers, sound toggle, Arc-style
 scrollbars, no bookmarks bar or startup infobars

Every small icon button hovers with the copy button's rounded square (no ink
drops); New tab gets the white 5% row hover; the sound toggle (sound on/off
icons) sits 7px after the favicon; web scrollbars are overlay, a 5px white 60%
line; no bookmarks bar, startup infobars or separator above the page; sidebar
at least 210px wide, 14px text, 15% divider, Saturn logo for settings.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
